propertyDetails.title=Property details
propertyDetails.informationFor=Information for:
propertyDetails.publicInformation=Public information
propertyDetails.publicInformationHint=Anybody can view this information
propertyDetails.band=Council Tax band
propertyDetails.band.hint=The current band for the property. This is based on the property value on 01 April 1991.
propertyDetails.effectiveFrom=With effect from
propertyDetails.effectiveFrom.hint= The date the current band came into effect.
propertyDetails.localAuthority=Local Council
propertyDetails.localAuthority.hint=The Local Council sets the amount of Council Tax you pay each year, based on the band.
propertyDetails.reference=Local Council reference number
propertyDetails.reference.hint=A reference number for the property.
propertyDetails.improvementIndicator=Improvement indicator
propertyDetails.improvementIndicator.hint=If a property has been improved or extended since it was placed in a Council Tax band, a Yes will be shown. This means the band will be reviewed and may increase following the sale of the property.
propertyDetails.mixedUse=Mixed-use property
propertyDetails.mixedUse.hint=A property which is used as a home and a business. For example, a working farm or a flat above a shop.
propertyDetails.courtCode=Court code
propertyDetails.courtCode.hint=If the Council Tax band has been reviewed by a Valuation Tribunal or High Court, a court code will be shown.
propertyDetails.councilTaxBands=Council Tax bands England
propertyDetails.codeMeaning=What the codes mean
propertyDetails.beforeContinue=Before you continue
propertyDetails.youCan=You can:
propertyDetails.previousBands=View previous Council Tax bands for this property
propertyDetails.actionOne=tell us if you think the Council Tax band is wrong if you pay Council Tax for the property, or have permission from the Council Tax payer
propertyDetails.actionTwo=ask us to remove the property from the Council Tax list if it has been demolished, is derelict, or is undergoing major renovation
propertyDetails.signIn=You'll need a GOV Gateway or GOV.UK One Login Account to sign in.
propertyDetails.print=Print this page
propertyDetails.searchAnother=Search for another property

selfCert.title=Are you responsible for the Council Tax on this property?
selfCert.heading=Are you responsible for the Council Tax on this property?
selfCert.guidance=Only people who are responsible for the Council Tax on this property have permission to view more details. This includes people acting for someone who is responsible.
selfCert.warning=If you are not responsible for the Council Tax on this property, you should not continue with this service.
selfCert.actingForSomeone=I am acting for someone who is responsible
selfCert.permissionHint=You will need their written permission
selfCert.error.required=Select whether you are responsible for the Council Tax on this property

